 "notes": "Source is a typed coach sheet with no title or date; date 2006-04-25 comes from the file name (lewiston4_25boys), boys from the file name. Meet name built from the four team names in the score line. Codes L/W/B/M (also lew/wat/bru) expanded to Lewiston/Waterville/Brunswick/Marancook from the printed team score line (first four teams, in that order, are the only candidates by initial). Relay codes lew/wat/bru expanded the same way; relay athletes not listed. Event headings: '300hh' written as 300 Meter Hurdles; '4x100 l' read as 4x100 relay (the stray 'l' ignored). Place numbers sometimes missing in the print (200 place 2, 110hh place 4, 1600 places 2-3, 3200 places 2 and 5, 800 place 2 and 3/5, etc.): implied by order. Rows with no school code printed left with school empty: 200 Sirois, shot put Roberts, 1600 race walk Jalbert, pole vault Collella, discus Turgeon (printed '111W-10', stray W; Turgeon is B in shot put but not guessed) and Roberts. Rows left out: 110 hurdles place 5 Ashton (no mark printed), 1600 race walk place 1 Vachon (no mark printed). Truncated marks left as printed: 200 Turcotte '25.', 300 hurdles Poulin '52.', 400 Merrill '63.' (probably 1:03.x). 800 Lucier '23.8' left as printed (likely 2:13.8 but not certain). Normalised forms: 345.9 -> 3:45.9, 351.9 -> 3:51.9, 409.1 -> 4:09.1, 855 -> 8:55 (no tenths printed), 906.9 -> 9:06.9, 928.8 -> 9:28.8, 65.3 -> 1:05.3 (400), 451 -> 4:51, 500.3 -> 5:00.3, 503.8 -> 5:03.8, 505.0 -> 5:05.0, 515.0 -> 5:15.0, 1100 -> 11:00, 1114 -> 11:14, 1116.6, 1119.3, 1136, 211.2 -> 2:11.2, 211.5, 219.5, 223.9, race walk 911.3, 934.1, 1035.1, '1035. 4' -> 10:35.4. Field marks: 5'8 -> 5-08; 19'3/4 -> 19-03.75; 40-1 1/2 -> 40-01.5; 37' -> 37-00; 12' -> 12-00 etc. Names kept as printed (case normalised); 1600 'L b Mohamed L 451' read as B. Mohamed (3200 prints 'B Mohamed L'), the first 'L' taken as a stray. 'cyr L' in 100 and 'c thibeault' in 400 kept as surname Cyr and 'C. Thibeault'. Spellings vary between event